Subject: [PATCH 431/488] [DS4.1] The verified tokens' logits rows in TileLang

The rejection sampler's logprobs laid each request's verified tokens out
at its logits rows with a torch zeros and the Triton flatten kernel. One
TileLang launch now writes every row: a request's sampled tokens, and 0
past them and past the last request. Tested against the Triton kernel
on its zeros.
